Package: libgsf-1-114
Version: @DEB_LIBGSF_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libgsf
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libxml2, libz-ng2
Description: GNOME structured file library
 libgsf provides access to structured file formats such as OLE2 and Zip-based
 document containers. This iOS build disables optional bzip2 and thumbnailer
 support for a small Gnumeric dependency surface.
